  m_text: "Ranged-hazmat suited fighter with a mysophobic mutation. Likes bubble
    baths, possibly because of his surprisingly bubbly personality.\n\n He always
    enters a battle with his hazmat suit as clean as a rubber duckies hide and always
    exits his battles covered in blood and grime. \r\n"
